ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Surrealism
Board: /styles/surrealism
Companions: surrealism-starter.html, surrealism-study.ai, surrealism-study.psd

Document
2400 × 1600 px, 300 ppi. Daylight ground, not a dream fog.

Layer stack, top to bottom
- Margin note: "second method"
- Object, hard edges, #c0c6ce
- One shadow, multiply, low opacity, offset in one direction
- Ground, simple gradient from #d7e0ea to #c8bba8

Rules
No cloud filter, no blur gallery, no pasted fur, no clock.
The impossibility is what the object is doing. The paint stays descriptive.
